# Locally-generated dev TLS cert/key (see vite.config.ts) — machine-specific,
# self-signed, regenerate per-dev via the openssl command in certs/README.md
# rather than sharing a private key through version control. san.cnf and
# README.md (the regeneration recipe) are NOT secret and stay tracked.
certs/dev-cert.pem
certs/dev-key.pem

